    "Description": "MariaDB is a multi-user, multi-threaded SQL database server that is binary compatible with MySQL. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* mariadb: MariaDB: mariadb-dump utility vulnerable to remote code execution via improper path validation (CVE-2025-13699)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
